    <criterion testable="true">Given the corrected doc, when the `sprk_communicationtype` options are read, then `100000004: Message` is listed alongside Email/Teams Message/SMS/Notification (matches `CommunicationType.cs`).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the corrected doc, when the `sprk_communication` field table is read, then each verified R1 messaging column (ACS message id, ACS thread id, `sprk_communicationthread` lookup, and any other verified R1 addition) is documented with logical name, type, and description.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the change, when the diff is inspected, then only `docs/data-model/sprk_communication.md` (and this project's notes/TASK-INDEX) is modified — no `src/`, `tests/`, or `.claude/` file changes.</criterion>
